},
{
"id": "S1L265",
"start": 5315,
"end": 5332,
"text": "DMARC monitoring\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L266",
"start": 5332,
"end": 5364,
"text": "Starts at $14 /month per domain\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L267",
"start": 5364,
"end": 5498,
"text": "Fix authentication issues that prevent your email from reaching the inbox and see who’s sending using your domain with DMARC Digests.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L268",
"start": 5498,
"end": 5511,
"text": "Learn more →\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L269",
"start": 5511,
"end": 5572,
"text": "All the tools you need to make managing your emails a breeze\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L270",
"start": 5572,
"end": 5644,
"text": "Industry-leading delivery speeds. Up to 4x faster than other providers.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L271",
"start": 5644,
"end": 5775,
"text": "Take the pain out of handling inbound email. Postmark turns inbound email into a handy JSON object and posts it to a web hook URL.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L272",
"start": 5775,
"end": 5885,
"text": "Responsive templates for sending transactional emails, including welcome messages, password resets, and more.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L273",
"start": 5885,
"end": 6004,
"text": "45 days worth of full content history by default to help you troubleshoot (customizable from 7 to 365 days if needed).\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L274",
"start": 6004,
"end": 6092,
"text": "We share our delivery statistics to the major inbox providers right on our status page.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L275",
"start": 6092,
"end": 6159,
"text": "Reliable link tracking so you can monitor and improve your emails.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L276",
"start": 6159,
"end": 6194,
"text": "See how Postmark stacks up against\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L277",
"start": 6194,
"end": 6224,
"text": "other email service providers\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L278",
"start": 6224,
"end": 6269,
"text": "Select a provider below to see a comparison.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L279",
"start": 6269,
"end": 6307,
"text": "Here’s what our customers think of us\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L280",
"start": 6307,
"end": 6695,
"text": "Postmark has a reputation for high quality. Even though there are several good companies, we were convinced by Postmark’s clear documentation and transparent roadmap. Further, building email infrastructure is really a partnership — we wanted to invest in a platform that would continue to grow along with our needs, not one that was fairly static and falling behind the technology curve.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L281",
"start": 6695,
"end": 6715,
"text": "Read the full story\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L282",
"start": 6715,
"end": 6727,
"text": "Cliff Chang\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L283",
"start": 6727,
"end": 6753,
"text": "Product Engineer at Asana\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L284",
"start": 6753,
"end": 6924,
"text": "I was shocked to see Postmark open rates were an 11% improvement over SES in our test. Needless to say we started sending all of our transactional email through Postmark.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L285",
"start": 6924,
"end": 6938,
"text": "Dave Marshall\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L286",
"start": 6938,
"end": 6961,
"text": "CTO at Childcare.co.uk\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L287",
"start": 6961,
"end": 7213,
"text": "We’re really happy we decided to use Postmark for ITV’s British Soap Awards. We only count votes from verified email addresses and Postmark’s excellent delivery has lead to our highest verification percentage ever. We'll definitely use Postmark again!\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L288",
"start": 7213,
"end": 7227,
"text": "Owen Matthews\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L289",
"start": 7227,
"end": 7260,
"text": "Creative Director at Ten4 Design\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L290",
"start": 7260,
"end": 7333,
"text": "Postmark blows every other transactional email product out of the water.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L291",
"start": 7333,
"end": 7344,
"text": "Kyle Racki\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L292",
"start": 7344,
"end": 7361,
"text": "CEO at Proposify\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L293",
"start": 7361,
"end": 7388,
"text": "Frequently Asked Questions\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L294",
"start": 7388,
"end": 7415,
"text": "Do you offer a free trial?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L295",
"start": 7415,
"end": 7549,
"text": "All new accounts start off on our free developer plan with 100 emails per month. Use it for however long you need, it doesn’t expire.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L296",
"start": 7549,
"end": 7577,
"text": "Do you offer dedicated IPs?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L297",
"start": 7577,
"end": 7679,
"text": "Dedicated IPs are available to high-volume senders. Read about our policy for issuing dedicated IPs .\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L298",
"start": 7679,
"end": 7736,
"text": "What happens if I go over my plan’s monthly email limit?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L299",
"start": 7736,
"end": 7872,
"text": "Extra emails on our paid plans are calculated at the end of your billing cycle and included with your plan cost for the upcoming month.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L300",
"start": 7872,
"end": 7920,
"text": "Visit our support article for more information.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L301",
"start": 7920,
"end": 7954,
"text": "What payment types do you accept?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L302",
"start": 7954,
"end": 8074,
"text": "We accept payments via Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Diners, and JCB. We do not accept PayPal or Purchase Orders.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L303",
"start": 8074,
"end": 8127,
"text": "Do you have a tier smaller than 10,000 emails/month?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L304",
"start": 8127,
"end": 8226,
"text": "We do not offer a tier between 100 emails/month (our free developer plan) and 10,000 emails/month.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L305",
"start": 8226,
"end": 8276,
"text": "Can I send bulk marketing email through Postmark?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L306",
"start": 8276,
"end": 8586,
"text": "Yes you can! To comply with industry best practices and to maintain our high deliverability, it's important though that transactional and marketing emails never mix. That's why we created Message Streams , a parallel but completely separate sending infrastructures for your transactional and broadcast emails.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L307",
"start": 8586,
"end": 8618,
"text": "Do you offer high-volume plans?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L308",
"start": 8618,
"end": 8679,
"text": "Yes! Contact us to learn more about our high-volume pricing.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L309",
"start": 8679,
"end": 8727,
"text": "Do unused emails roll over into the next month?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L310",
"start": 8727,
"end": 8860,
"text": "No. If you are under your email limit at the end of a billing period, the unused emails do not roll over to the next billing period.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L311",
"start": 8860,
"end": 8912,
"text": "Do you offer a discount for bootstrapped companies?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L312",
"start": 8912,
"end": 9103,
"text": "Yes! If you’ve launched your product, are charging for it, and haven’t taken outside investment, contact our support team and we’ll give you $75 account credit to help with your email costs.\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L313",
"start": 9103,
"end": 9130,
"text": "Do you offer annual plans?\n"
},
{
"id": "S1L314",
"start": 9130,
"end": 9363,
"text": "Not right now, but we’d like to! We’re looking at introducing annual plans, which can offer some flexibility to customers who have lower and/or seasonal volume. Contact us if you’d like to be notified when we introduce annual plans.\n"
},
{
